// Title: PDQ Deploy Remote Adminstartion Tool Execution
// Sigma ID: d679950c-abb7-43a6-80fb-2a480c4fc450
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2022-10-01 | Modified: 2023-01-30
// ATT&CK: execution, lateral-movement, T1072
// Description: Detect use of PDQ Deploy remote admin tool
// False positives:
//   - Legitimate use
// References:
//   - https://github.com/redcanaryco/atomic-red-team/blob/9e5b12c4912c07562aec7500447b11fa3e17e254/atomics/T1072/T1072.md
//   - https://www.pdq.com/pdq-deploy/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/ccbb0369507f796db0b0ae6854c8a2be471b9d84/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_pdqdeploy_execution.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where ProcessVersionInfoFileDescription =~ "PDQ Deploy Console" or ProcessVersionInfoProductName =~ "PDQ Deploy" or ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName =~ "PDQ.com" or ProcessVersionInfoOriginalFileName =~ "PDQDeployConsole.exe"
